   "": {
    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the municipal home rule law, in relation to punishment for the\nviolation of a local law",
    "basePrintNo": "S8272",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S8272-2017",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [],
     "size": 0
    },
    "fullText": "",
    "fullTextFormats": [],
    "fullTextHtml": "",
    "fullTextTemplate": "",
    "lawCode": "Amd §10, Munic Home R L",
    "lawSection": "Municipal Home Rule Law",
    "memo": "\n \nBILL NUMBER: S8272\n\nSPONSOR: GALLIVAN\n \nTITLE OF BILL:  An act to amend the municipal home rule law, in\nrelation to punishment for the violation of a local law\n\n \nPURPOSE:\n\nTo provide for community service as one of the punishments regarding a\nviolation of a local law.\n\n \nSUMMARY OF PROVISIONS:\n\nSection 1 of the bill codifies as a means of punishment for violating a\nlocal law the ability to perform community service.\n\nSection 2 establishes the effective date.\n\n \nJUSTIFICATION:\n\nState law prescribes the type of punishment, which may be imposed by a\nmunicipality, pursuant to local law, to include a civil penalty, fine,\nforfeiture or imprisonment. This legislation will add to the type of\npunishment, community service for a violation of a local law as well.\n\n \nLEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\n2017-18: A.5539A - referred to local governments\n\n \nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS:\n\nNone\n\n \nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nThis Act shall take effect immediately.\n",
    "multiSponsors": {
     "items": [],
     "size": 0
    },
